  "reviewNotes": [
    "Arcane Eye, Concordant Mindlink and Legend Lore are Universal in all current class placements. Do not substitute thematic Divination school for generating school or treat every invisible remote sensor as covered by a Divination-only barrier. Detect Magic still needs its actual visible/perceived aura predicate; class Arcane Sight is separate actual acquisition/concentration source.",
    "Prophetic Frenzy/Faction Prophecy rank5 cost10; Path/Faction Destiny/Resonance Prophecy rank6 cost13; all actual class minimum levels retained, including Mirrorsage/Shaman16 for rank6. Arcane Eye rank4 cost7; Mindlink/Lore rank5 cost10. No blanket9RP or Wizard-only access.",
    "Concordant Mindlink has no Core entries; do not invent a recovered Core line. Full native catalog placement remains authoritative and added duration/roster/send rules must be identified as selected authored choices.",
    "Native Resonance Prophecy predicts all effects for the next minute. Any conversion to commitment warning must be explicitly selected/disclosed as substantive authoring, not silently called native forecasting. Retain no arbitrary spell rank/count cap and actual earlier commitment vs later arrival evidence.",
    "Real institutional facts, finite route/history premises, protection/no-leak handling and exact player Reaction visibility remain the25-question conference obligations already preserved in126/127. No new choice or case is accepted by these notes."
  ],
